        "t": 155.82100000000003,
        "r": 562.3830999999997,
        "b": 116.22429999999997
      },
      "content": "The recovery water enters the unit at inlet connection (1). In heat exchanger (HE) the compression heat is transferred from the compressor oil to the water. The water leaves heat exchanger (HE) via outlet connection (2).",
